{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution.\n[[cite:obs-aeba6c0a8cd206763a7df1508658dd706b1e74f3 \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n\nThe amount a member pays each year is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\n[[cite:obs-c819d67d18ebf0f59f7537dc39660ddd71b1b8da \"Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\"]]","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added statements about the membership fee and the yearly amount paid by members, each followed by exact citations from the charter and annex sources as required."}